            "review_title": "Review at Quan Nhau Sau Luong",
            "review_text": "Jolubaba\nOakland, California99 contributions\n1\nAn authentic Vietnamese experience\nSep 2018 • Friends\nIn Da Nang seafood restaurants are a dime in a dozen. There’s no wrong choosing here, they’re all good and fresh. This one takes the cake, it is an authentic Vietnamese experience. Their food is excellent, the service is prompt, and the entertainment is free. You get free musicians/singers coming around serenading the patrons. We had a feast with all the seafood we could possibly eat for a fraction of what we would’ve pay in the States. And you asked “How fresh is the food”? It’s the catch of the day, literally. Picked up from the Bay across the street! And the beer is cheap too. Enjoy!\nRead more\nWritten September 28, 2018",
